# Running the CodeRabbit CLI

CodeRabbit is installed in the terminal and can be used to review code changes.

## Commands

- Run `cr -h` to see available commands and options.
- Prefer running CodeRabbit with the `--agent` flag.
- For uncommitted changes, run `coderabbit --agent -t uncommitted`.

## Limits

- Do not run CodeRabbit more than 3 times for the same set of code changes.
